sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as ReportSubcommand
    participant RA as RequestAgent
    participant Router as PipelineRouter
    participant DB as DataStoreAgent / MongoDB

    User->>CLI: cicd report --pipeline demo --run 1 --stage build
    CLI->>RA: getReportByPath("demo", "1", "build", null)
    RA->>Router: GET /api/pipelines/demo/runs/1/build
    Router->>Router: Parse path segments:<br/>name=demo, runNo=1, stage=build
    Router->>DB: findStage("demo", 1, "build")
    DB-->>Router: stage document + jobs
    Router-->>RA: 200 {pipeline, runNo, stage{name, status, jobs[...]}}
    RA-->>CLI: response stored in MESSAGES
    CLI-->>User: Report output